{"data": [{"author_id": "1390481079333687298", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036600819630128"], "id": "2117036600819630128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot And if you're looking for cool Grok Bot templates to tryout, and get to know the people who are making them, come check out the site in my bio!  :)", "url": "https://x.com/RichSilver/status/2117036600819630128"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036580892188699"], "id": "2117036580892188699", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@qian_li9829 @lianyi520 @0xKevin00 我这就把你的要求发到你的 Grok Bot 上，让它直接动手。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117036580892188699"}, {"author_id": "2026810291477213184", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036554220896749"], "id": "2117036554220896749", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@FuSheng_0306 grok bot和muse，是杂分工干活的呀？", "url": "https://x.com/MLJspVXm1893005/status/2117036554220896749"}, {"author_id": "1678870737271107585", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036553088217524"], "id": "2117036553088217524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk Grok Bot is “the greatest thing that’s ever happened to AI” and “incredibly useful,” right?\n\nThen why did my usage randomly spike 50% this weekend with zero notice, zero transparency, and support still ignoring the ticket? Peak usefulness or scam?", "url": "https://x.com/ReallyJone/status/2117036553088217524"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot 模板合集：53 个现成模板，按场景分好 7 类，点一下就能复制来用"}, "author_id": "825796613000028160", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036550550663588"], "id": "2117036550550663588", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "别人把 Grok Bot 都调好了，点一下就能搬过来用。\n\n我筛了 53 个模板，按社媒运营、资料抓取、监控提醒、图片视频、营销销售、编程开发、办公助理分好 7 类，逐个写清能干啥、有什么坑。53 个的单独介绍页全收录在 https://t.co/JzJxVKxbVR，合集长文在这👇 https://t.co/TiWXySRS50", "url": "https://x.com/btc5767/status/2117036550550663588"}, {"author_id": "1855813895379681280", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036550353744278"], "id": "2117036550353744278", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok 4.8 needs to focus on efficiency or we might lose this version of Grok Bot that we all know and love. https://t.co/ycX1aeETyh", "url": "https://x.com/RockyRoad226/status/2117036550353744278"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036542841569370"], "id": "2117036542841569370", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@kevin_sekol @Ishansharma7390 @grok Got it, sending your ask over to your Grok Bot so it can dig in. It’ll take the handoff from there.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117036542841569370"}, {"author_id": "1516829979820052487", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036515062628634"], "id": "2117036515062628634", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@MindandEmotion7 @elonmusk @DogecoinNorway @grok @bot Yes. This is how I run my setup. Standing order is to use my Ollama setup with local Qwen for all the heavy lifting, with Claude or Codex for QC, before handing back to Grokbot. Local AI does all the heavy lifting while Grokbot orchestrates.", "url": "https://x.com/JusticeIsComing/status/2117036515062628634"}, {"author_id": "272822625", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036514924269696"], "id": "2117036514924269696", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@santtiagom_ Teniendo el pro de todos, grok bot es el que menos prestaciones da. Codex pro me resulta 100 veces mejor que grok bot pro.", "url": "https://x.com/ezequieldamico/status/2117036514924269696"}, {"author_id": "1056509894176714752", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036511933653487"], "id": "2117036511933653487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @bot @ChatGPT https://t.co/h6keTGzvnh\n\nThis should be public? I set it to the same access as the gatekeeper report @grok", "url": "https://x.com/Elerrzerrberthh/status/2117036511933653487"}, {"author_id": "293248216", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036510440546765"], "id": "2117036510440546765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot From Grok Bot usage resets mid week to Grok Bot usage cut in half mid week.", "url": "https://x.com/SchootyBoo/status/2117036510440546765"}, {"author_id": "2074623117113061376", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036502576189480"], "id": "2117036502576189480", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot 10X’d my productivity but needs more usage! Also hoping Grok 4.8 is out soon, and faster than 4.7", "url": "https://x.com/RagnarLongstock/status/2117036502576189480"}, {"author_id": "469451666", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036492996424182"], "id": "2117036492996424182", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot Running a whole team of Grok bots since October and it's a game changer!! New features every time I log in lol 💪🏼 #GrokBot", "url": "https://x.com/TSak70/status/2117036492996424182"}, {"author_id": "1128727054675898368", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036492031979524"], "id": "2117036492031979524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot Well I already love grok and def had my eye out for Claude but this is genius!!!", "url": "https://x.com/AI_ROBO_RAVE/status/2117036492031979524"}, {"author_id": "2110639930565091328", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036484192850130"], "id": "2117036484192850130", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot Grok bot is the greatest thing ever but please implement 2FA in cursor. Its bizarre that Cursor did not implement 2FA", "url": "https://x.com/kittycatmix/status/2117036484192850130"}, {"author_id": "1982599101461278720", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:30:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036478832472561"], "id": "2117036478832472561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "t