ón de Claude Code.\n\nEs mas potente que utilizar Grok Bot, solo necesito aprovisionamiento en la nube.", "url": "https://x.com/BuilderDeploy/status/2117036466823942207"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117036438453972994"]}, "author_id": "91144157", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036444284080134"], "id": "2117036444284080134", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@SawyerMerritt Grok Bot also think it’s the worst handling, they should communicate beforehand with customers https://t.co/Zew7CTm1OO", "url": "https://x.com/millepun/status/2117036444284080134"}, {"author_id": "1947064109381656577", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036444225028374"], "id": "2117036444225028374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Yo les mecs hermes ou grok bot ?\n\nJ’ai besoin de passer un cap Claude code c’est bien beau mais j’ai besoin d’une interface plus pensé pour le multi-agent", "url": "https://x.com/xmathisai/status/2117036444225028374"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117036218491826176"]}, "author_id": "476654292", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036425434792334"], "id": "2117036425434792334", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @bot I love the Grok @bot and my assistants. And their numbers are growing all the time 👇 https://t.co/JcepAgbEHT", "url": "https://x.com/nrlartt/status/2117036425434792334"}, {"author_id": "1389833864122613761", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117036419487014924"], "id": "2117036419487014924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_cou